			"Message": "chore(Maintain): Expand CHANGELOG with comprehensive version history\n\nTransform the minimal CHANGELOG.md from a single \"Initial version\" entry into a comprehensive changelog following the Keep a Changelog format.\n\nDocuments all releases from 0.0.1 (2024 Q2) through 0.6.0 (2026 Q2), including initial CI/CD pipeline, GritQL infrastructure, Node.js sidecar support, build tool releases, guard disarm mechanism, and the latest documentation updates.\n\nThis ensures the Maintain element has proper release documentation aligned with semantic versioning and quarterly release cycles.",
